{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1289261-warstrider-that-needs-a-name","id":1289261,"title":"Warstrider That Needs A Name","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-18T12:07:38-08:00","id":1289261,"title":"Warstrider That Needs A Name","content":"In one of my games, a Twilight has just fought and won for a mine's worth of Blue Jade, with the intent to form it into a Warstrider, before having an Air Aspect ally start using it (the story introducing the artefact is a mix of rumour and truth)<br /> <br /> I've statted up what I believe is a warstrider that makes sense, and combos into Dragon-Blooded Charms related to its operation and general oeuvre, but I'm not 100% convinced that I'm happy with all the Evocation. The big problem, however, is that none of our group can come up with a name that isn't &quot;Stormcaller&quot;, &quot;Stormbringer&quot;, or &quot;The Teapot Tempest&quot;. I'd really appreciate suggestions for names, as well as feedback on the artefact and its mechanics.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/14N40IDPbX8LOR9M4Hpzzj4vkp3ULoNtcu7uiwFbpVIA/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Here's the artefact.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12692-whybover","name":"Whybover","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T12:47:20-08:00","id":1289271,"title":"","content":"Thanks to my good friend Thesaurus.com I became a big fan of the world Fulmination, which is a strong work for Lightning and is a good end part of a name. This is where you get Righteous Fulmination, or Calamitous Fulmination, or Tenacious Fulmination.<br /> <br /> Or you can put it on the from and go with Fulminating as the descriptor. This gets you names like Fulminating Vigil, or Fulminating Sentry, or Fulminating Cataclysm.<br /> <br /> If you wanted to go with the Storm angle, you've got Cyclone, Gale, Monsoon, Squall, and Tempest as good words to work with as well.<br /> <br /> Just a few thoughts from 5 minutes on Thesaurus.com","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T13:15:27-08:00","id":1289283,"title":"","content":"I think that three word names both do a better job of avoiding the feeling of having heard them before and have a very Exalted feel. Using Unsung Hero's suggestions, things like the following appeal to me:<br /> <br /> Cerulean Tempest Vanguard <br /> Fulminating Cyclone Colossus<br /> Cataclysm of Cobalt Thunder<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I want to play <a href=\"https://forum.atlas-games.com/t/adelbert-a-magi-of-hermes-look-at-intellego-and-astrology/8146/382\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> as a starting character, I don't even care what game.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T13:16:47-08:00","id":1289285,"title":"","content":"<b>Pacific Rim Style Names</b><br /> Tempest Wisdom<br /> Phantom Whirlwind<br /> Monsoon Brilliance<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>One Word Names</b><br /> Thunderstrike<br /> Cloudburst<br /> Brightcaller<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Longer Names</b><br /> Downpour of Enlightenment<br /> Writer With Cuneiform Lightning<br /> Heart of Thunder<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T03:16:22-08:00","id":1289454,"title":"","content":"Fulminating Cataclysm, Cataclysm of Cobalt Thunder, Monsoon Brilliance, and Downpour of Enlightenment all being submitted to my group. Thanks so much.<br /> <br /> I take it from the lack of mechanics-chatter that people aren't seeing too many glaring flaws?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12692-whybover","name":"Whybover","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T03:53:20-08:00","id":1289460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Whybover</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1289261-warstrider-that-needs-a-name?p=1289454#post1289454\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I take it from the lack of mechanics-chatter that people aren't seeing too many glaring flaws?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it looks fine but if you want better mechanical scrutiny I'd suggest making another thread. Generally speaking different people click on &quot;I need a name for something&quot; threads vs. Please Evaluate and Critique Honestly.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T08:50:27-08:00","id":1289542,"title":"","content":"I didn't even notice the link to the artifact until I read these last comments.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I want to play <a href=\"https://forum.atlas-games.com/t/adelbert-a-magi-of-hermes-look-at-intellego-and-astrology/8146/382\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> as a starting character, I don't even care what game.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T10:27:32-08:00","id":1289581,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1289261-warstrider-that-needs-a-name?p=1289460#post1289460\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it looks fine but if you want better mechanical scrutiny I'd suggest making another thread. Generally speaking different people click on &quot;I need a name for something&quot; threads vs. Please Evaluate and Critique Honestly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh damn, you're so right! It's been so long since I posted with the intent of getting feedback I forgot to include PEACH.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12692-whybover","name":"Whybover","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T10:38:04-08:00","id":1289582,"title":"","content":"The only mechanical thing that stood out to me right away is the lack of mechanics for the lightning in the chest. It seems to be the focus of how the warstrider attacks, but what are the mechanics for it? It can throw it, so it's a Thrown attack? What's the range? Is it a light, medium, heavy weapon? Mundane or Artifact? Does it do anything else? What does &quot;trivial opponents can be defeated by these flashes&quot; mean? It's really not clear. Can't assess the rest without knowing that bit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T22:35:42-08:00","id":1289815,"title":"","content":"The lightning is the Hurled Lightning Weapon described in the stat line, I can only apologise that this wasn\u2019t made more clear. It\u2019s a Medium thrown weapon with medium range. Like all Warstrider weapons, it\u2019s treated as an artefact. Without Evocations, it does nothing special; an Evocation for DB let\u2019s them use Elemental Bolt Attack\u2019s benefits with it.<br /> <br /> Trivial opponents can be \u201cdeafened\u201d by bursts of thunder, was the intention. Which was a roundabout way of saying \u201cit\u2019s very loud, but not mechanically loud enough to do anything in a proper battle\u201d.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12692-whybover","name":"Whybover","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-20T08:51:24-08:00","id":1289950,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Whybover</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1289261-warstrider-that-needs-a-name?p=1289815#post1289815\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The lightning is the Hurled Lightning Weapon described in the stat line, I can only apologise that this wasn\u2019t made more clear. It\u2019s a Medium thrown weapon with medium range. Like all Warstrider weapons, it\u2019s treated as an artefact. Without Evocations, it does nothing special; an Evocation for DB let\u2019s them use Elemental Bolt Attack\u2019s benefits with it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ahh, I would move the weapon under the Attunement bonus section so there's a relationship between the two. &quot;Attuning lets you use the weapon and here's the weapon stats.&quot; But either way that's just my overlooking it, so no worries.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Whybover</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1289261-warstrider-that-needs-a-name?p=1289815#post1289815\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Trivial opponents can be \u201cdeafened\u201d by bursts of thunder, was the intention. Which was a roundabout way of saying \u201cit\u2019s very loud, but not mechanically loud enough to do anything in a proper battle\u201d.</div> </div> </div> </div>And again with my misreading. I read it wrong. I would put a duration on the deafening and... are there laid out penalties for deafening in the core book? If so, no worries, if not I'd put the penalty in here too. But at least a duration, else it could be interpreted as instant and done or permanent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-22T01:24:20-08:00","id":1290686,"title":"","content":"Is it too late to suggest 'Kamikaze'? I'm told it means 'Divine Wind' and could fit a more reckless pilot...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I thank the Devs for the great game of Exalted!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12735-bjornthefellhanded","name":"BjornTheFellhanded","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12735_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"327"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}